    These Terms &amp; Conditions (&ldquo;<strong>Terms</strong>&rdquo;) form a binding agreement
    between you (&ldquo;<strong>you</strong>&rdquo;) and us and govern your access to and use of the <em>{site.name}</em> mobile application, together with our related websites, services,
