  </p>
  <p>
    Please also read <strong>Section 6 (No Real-Money Gambling)</strong> and <strong>Section 7
    (AI Opponents, Matchmaking &amp; Game Outcomes)</strong> carefully, as they describe
    important characteristics of how the App works.
  </p>

  <h2>2. Definitions</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>&ldquo;App&rdquo;</strong> has the meaning given in Section 1.</li>
    <li><strong>&ldquo;AI Opponent&rdquo;</strong> means a computer-controlled opponent operated by the App's systems, as described in Section 7.</li>
    <li><strong>&ldquo;Virtual Currency&rdquo;</strong> means the in-App balances we make available, currently <strong>Coins</strong> and <strong>Gems</strong>, used solely within the App.</li>
    <li><strong>&ldquo;Virtual Items&rdquo;</strong> means non-currency digital content within the App, including board themes, cosmetics, boosters, passes, and similar items.</li>
    <li><strong>&ldquo;In-App Purchase&rdquo;</strong> means a purchase of Virtual Currency, Virtual Items, subscriptions, or other digital content made through the Apple App Store or Google Play.</li>
    <li><strong>&ldquo;Store&rdquo;</strong> means the Apple App Store or Google Play, as applicable.</li>
    <li><strong>&ldquo;Rewards&rdquo;</strong> means bonuses, prizes, wheel outcomes, mission and challenge payouts, and similar in-App benefits, in each case denominated in Virtual Currency or Virtual Items.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>3. The App</h2>
  <p>
    <em>{site.name}</em> is a mobile backgammon game in which you can play backgammon matches
    against other players or AI Opponents, take part in game features, earn Rewards,
    unlock boards and other Virtual Items, and use Virtual Currency.
  </p>
  <p>The App is provided <strong>for entertainment purposes only</strong>.</p>

  <h2>4. Eligibility</h2>
  <p>
    You must be at least <strong>eighteen (18) years old</strong>, or the age of majority in
    your jurisdiction if higher, to use the App.
  </p>
  <p>
    By using the App you represent and warrant that you meet this requirement and that
    you are not barred from using the App under the laws of your jurisdiction.
  </p>
  <p>
    We may restrict or condition access to the App, or to particular features,
    purchases, or competitions, based on age, location, Store rules, legal
    requirements, risk, or our operational policies.
  </p>

  <h2>5. Accounts</h2>
  <p>
    Some features require an account, which may be a guest/device account or an account
    created through a third-party or platform login (such as Google sign-in).
  </p>
  <p>
    You are responsible for maintaining the confidentiality and security of your account
    and device, and for all activity that occurs under your account. You must not share,
    sell, rent, transfer, or grant any other person access to your account.
  </p>
  <p>
    We are not responsible for any loss arising from forgotten credentials, deleted or
    reset accounts, device changes, account sharing, or third-party platform
    restrictions. We may suspend, restrict, reset, or terminate accounts in accordance
    with Section 20.
  </p>

  <h2>6. No Real-Money Gambling</h2>
  <p>
    <em>{site.name}</em> is a game of mixed skill and chance played with Virtual Currency and
    Virtual Items for entertainment. <strong>The App does not offer real-money gambling, and
    Virtual Currency, Virtual Items, and Rewards are not a form of betting or wagering
    for money or anything of monetary value.</strong>
  </p>
  <p>Virtual Currency, Virtual Items, and Rewards:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>have <strong>no cash or monetary value</strong>;</li>
    <li><strong>cannot</strong> be exchanged, redeemed, or converted into real money or any item of real-world value;</li>
    <li><strong>cannot</strong> be withdrawn, cashed out, transferred, sold, or traded outside the App; and</li>
    <li>do <strong>not</strong> constitute deposits, winnings, financial instruments, securities, or stored value.</li>
  </ul>
  <p>
    Paying an entry amount in Virtual Currency to take part in a game, and any Virtual
    Currency or Virtual Items received as a result, are part of the in-App entertainment
    experience only. <strong>Winning</strong> any match, mission, challenge, bonus, wheel spin, or
    other feature does <strong>not</strong> entitle you to money, real-world prizes, or anything of
    monetary value, except where we expressly state otherwise in separate official
    promotional terms.
  </p>
  <p>
    You agree not to use the App for gambling, betting, wagering, money games,
    unauthorized contests, or any activity involving real-world monetary value.
  </p>

  <h2>7. AI Opponents, Matchmaking &amp; Game Outcomes</h2>
  <p>
    To provide a smooth and timely experience, the App's matchmaking will attempt to
    pair you with another human player. <strong>When a suitable human opponent is not
    available, your match may instead be played against an AI Opponent.</strong> AI Opponents
    may be presented within the App in the same manner as human opponents and may not be
    separately identified during play.
  </p>
  <p>
    We design, operate, and may adjust at any time, in our discretion, the App's
    matchmaking logic, AI Opponent behaviour and difficulty, Reward probabilities and
    payout rates, entry amounts, and prize amounts, including for reasons of game
    balance, fairness, player experience, economic sustainability, security, or legal
    compliance. The outcome of any match, and the result of any randomized Reward, is
    determined by the App's systems.
  </p>
  <p>
    Because all entry amounts, prizes, and Rewards are denominated in Virtual Currency
    and Virtual Items with no cash value (Section 6), <strong>no outcome &mdash; whether against a
    human or an AI Opponent &mdash; entitles you to money or anything of real-world value.</strong>
  </p>

  <h2>8. Virtual Currency and Virtual Items</h2>
  <p>
    The App includes Virtual Currency (currently <strong>Coins</strong> and <strong>Gems</strong>) and Virtual
